      "subject": "ויפח",
      "rationale": "Heburukan fɔcogo ye 'ka ninakili bisa' ye — nafa bɛ daɲɛ in kɔnɔ, Bamanankan tɛ o lamini dɔrɔn de ye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "ye … ye",
      "rationale": "Bamanankan ka kɛli-daɲɛ wajibi ye; Heburukan ma a sɛbɛn."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "marmayɛrɛ",
      "rationale": "מרמה ye 'marmayɛrɛ' ye; n'sigi kokura a kɔrɔ ye 'yɛrɛyɛrɛmajugu' ye"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Niw lalandi ye seeretigi tiɲɛnen ye; nka min bɛ fitaɲɛw bisa, o ye marmayɛrɛ ye.",
